                <pb facs="0734" n="626" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg626"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April 14, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received April 15.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister promises full satisfaction without formal demand before 22d. I have
                    granted the time.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
